@SimonWalczak Thanks for the feedback. The fields should be pulled from the equivalent fields from the forked-daapd server itself. Do the proper artist and album name show up when using the forked-daapd server web front end directly?
I think it's actually related to this issue https://github.com/ejurgensen/forked-daapd/issues/351 involving an intentional false mapping for internet streams on the forked-daapd server itself. I can work around this for HA by reversing the mapping of these fields for streams - I would just swap the album name and the title with each other. Would that fix your problem?
The art cover issue should be related to the other issue you opened and should be fixed when that PR goes through.
